# Test HTTP requests
### use with: REST Client extension

### GET all items
GET http://localhost:3000/items

### GET item with id
GET http://localhost:3000/items/3
content-type: application/json


### Add new item with id
POST http://localhost:3000/items
Content-Type: application/json

 {"name": "Mandariini"}

### Update item
PUT http://localhost:3000/items/5
Content-Type: application/json

 {"name": "päivitetty mandariini"}

### Delete item with id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/items/4
Content-Type: application/json 

 {"name": "Poistettu itemi"}

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

 {
    "username": "John Smith",
    "password": "password4",
    "email": "johnsmith@example.com"
    }

### Get user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/users/2
Content-Type: application/json

### Login succes
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

 {
    "username": "johndoe",
    "password": "password1"
 }

### Login fail
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

 {
    "username": "johndoe",
    "password": "väärä"
 }